# Multi-Model Prompt Cache Harmonizer (`multi-model-cache-harmonizer`)

Prompt caching provides **up to 90%–95% cost and quota discounts**, but is extremely fragile: altering a single character, timestamp, or whitespace in the prompt prefix invalidates the entire cached block.

This skill standardizes static prefix anchoring and dynamic suffix isolation across Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, OpenAI, and xAI Grok.

---

